e", "call_id": "toolu_01BaoEiZGCXcsszr8P55joyo", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53905, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BaoEiZGCXcsszr8P55joyo", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55135, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VkjnzA8hPuwoJ2ssJ9NeqH", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55435, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VkjnzA8hPuwoJ2ssJ9NeqH", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55435, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VkjnzA8hPuwoJ2ssJ9NeqH", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60451, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- The most recent healthy release was v2.3.0, so I rolled back to it.\n- The first attempt stopped partway because of an error in the deployment system: us-east was rolled back, but us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same version again is safe, so I retried once and it finished in all regions.\n- checkout-api is now on v2.3.0 everywhere, reports healthy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Creating the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list: the request had gone through, so there's no duplicate and the on-call engineer was paged only once.\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the retry), the current state, and follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate was also unhealthy) and looking into the deployment-system error during the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Xw151g8iMnMBavUpjS69j6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TFxX2UzEohU4KTPqugveGF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014D9LwFQo1gznfpE2niuu7S", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014r3CpygFS5AnpeV9AHWqPQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe, so I'm retrying once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01HBCJ3FuMxpULxpTaau7Zwn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MrkBczWcrgfxpwbrW7ijpC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HpEv