althy, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Creating the incident timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list: the request had gone through, so there's no duplicate and the on-call engineer was paged only once.\n- **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) is open. It covers the failure, the rollback (including the retry), the current state, and follow-ups: finding why v2.3.1 failed (its release candidate was also unhealthy) and looking into the deployment-system error during the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}